      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "¡Excelente! Aquí tienes la consulta SQL SELECT para BigQuery que recupera los conceptos relacionados con el `concept_id` **312327** (Artritis reumatoide) utilizando las tablas del vocabulario OMOP:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS source_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS source_concept_name,\n    cr.relationship_id,\n    r.relationship_name,\n    c2.concept_id AS target_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS target_concept_name,\n    c2.domain_id AS target_domain_id,\n    c2.vocabulary_id AS target_vocabulary_id\nFROM\n    `concept` AS c1\nJOIN\n    `concept_relationship` AS cr\nON\n    c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_1\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c2\nON\n    cr.concept_id_2 = c2.concept_id\nJOIN\n    `relationship` AS r\nON\n    cr.relationship_id = r.relationship_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id = 312327\n```",
