    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Gracias por la retroalimentación del evaluador. Esos filtros son realmente cruciales para la precisión de la traducción de conceptos.\n\nHe revisado y mejorado la consulta SQL para BigQuery OMOP CDM 5.4, incorporando el filtro para el tipo de relación específica (`'SNOMED - MedDRA eq'`) y asegurando la validez de la relación (`cr.invalid_reason IS NULL`).\n\nAquí tienes la consulta SQL corregida y ejecutable:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS source_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS source_concept_name,\n    cr.relationship_id,\n    r.relationship_name,\n    c2.concept_id AS target_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS target_concept_name,\n    c2.domain_id AS target_domain_id,\n    c2.vocabulary_id AS target_vocabulary_id\nFROM\n    `concept` AS c1\nJOIN\n    `concept_relationship` AS cr\nON\n    c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_1\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c2\nON\n    cr.concept_id_2 = c2.concept_id\nJOIN\n    `relationship` AS r\nON\n    cr.relationship_id = r.relationship_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id = 312327\n    AND cr.relationship_id = 'SNOMED - MedDRA eq'\n    AND cr.invalid_reason IS NULL\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CoEBAY89a1-y84enJ6z_Ihiua0NPLOhP1gNq2t4kmkobJZAwyJr2UbfYqOjsDBzMbx14v5jhMQYbw85gJ4NC1gZMi9XX5F7zmgTNJjeirnJ7GFCLAApAQyjKrcQJtD_figObnUmAhyXr7-Xz-yrpFpbNCO4Km7qFDeLXwB99alxWLSi1"
